//! The rendering contract and its renderers: a scene hands over a
//! G-buffer and proxies, and a renderer owns the light — light probes, a
//! path tracer, daylight, a workbench — with physically based shading,
//! the sky the air makes, lamps, a planar mirror, fog and clouds, a
//! camera, metered and local exposure, temporal antialiasing and
//! upscaling, depth of field, glow, film and a painted look.
package render@1 { language = 1; ir = 1; }

use "kernels/";
